<title>USA: Sioux City hogs $2.50-2.75 lower - update - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs $2.50-2.75 lower - update - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $2.50-2.75 lower. Trade moderately active. Top $60.00 per cwt. -</p>
<p>USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     60.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     59.50-60.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     57.50-59.00</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     53.50-56.50</p>
<p>Sows:  all weights 1.00-2.00 lower. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-500 lbs     45.50</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs     48.00</p>
<p>	   550-700 lbs     49.00</p>
</text>
